+ ##

- Out.println(signer.public.verify(document, signature).inspect)
+ Out.println(signer.public.verify(document, signature).inspect)

- Out.println(signer.public.verify(t"a forged document", signature).inspect)
+ Out.println(signer.public.verify(t"a forged document", signature).inspect)

= Out.println(signer.public.verify(t"a forged document", signature).inspect)
- ```
+ ```

