- ### ASN.1 and DER
+ ### ASN.1 und DER

- The structures beneath certificates, keys and signatures are
- [ASN.1](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ASN.1) values, carried in
- [DER](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X.690#DER_encoding). An `Asn1` value models that structure
- directly, as an enumeration of the universal types which certificates use, and `Der` is the
- encoded form:
+ Die Strukturen unter Zertifikaten, Schlüsseln und Signaturen sind
+ [ASN.1](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ASN.1)-Werte, transportiert in
+ [DER](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/X.690#DER_encoding). Ein `Asn1`-Wert modelliert diese
+ Struktur direkt, als Aufzählung der universellen Typen, die Zertifikate verwenden, und `Der` ist
+ die kodierte Form:

= encoded form:
=
- ```scala
+ ```scala

- val value = Asn1.Sequence(List(Asn1.Integer(BigInt(1)), Asn1.Utf8String(t"hello")))
+ val value = Asn1.Sequence(List(Asn1.Integer(BigInt(1)), Asn1.Utf8String(t"hello")))

- val bytes = value.in[Der]
+ val bytes = value.in[Der]

= val bytes = value.in[Der]
- ```
+ ```

= val bytes = value.in[Der]
= ```
=
- ```scala fuel
+ ```scala fuel

= val bytes = value.in[Der]
= ```
=
